g the same wire shape GET returns, plus ETag header. Path with NO parent_id (bare-id route): the resource scope pins only OrganizationID + the deep id, so the engine's covers() rule DENIES every scoped grant at the policy boundary (a grant with a pinned ProjectID cannot cover a resource with no ProjectID); principals whose only access is a scoped grant must use a parent-scoped route. Every NewHandler positional-arg addition triggers a ~50-site sweep across ~35 existing test files — anchor on `fakeXxxReader{}, nil)` and `fakeXxxReader{}, logger)` plus the `reader, nil)` / `reader, logger)` outliers in the resource's own get/policy test helpers. The newRouteTable-only OpenAPI shape tests (all-nils form, partial-fakes-with-trailing-nils form) each need one more `nil` appended. AVOID double-counting: run go vet AFTER each automated sweep and undo overshoots before continuing.
