+  - `govulncheck ./...` attempted; `govulncheck` is not installed.
+- Results
+  - All installed required and optional checks passed.
+  - `golangci-lint` reported `0 issues`.
+- Remaining risks or follow-ups
+  - The worker metric collector is in-process like the existing HTTP collector. A later exporter or worker metrics endpoint can expose `JobQueueMetricsSnapshot` without changing the series contract.
+- **Learnings for future iterations:**
+  - Queue metrics should be emitted only after the durable claim/outcome write succeeds; otherwise metrics can report work that was never committed.
+  - Job/request/resource identifiers are useful incident hints but must stay latest-sample fields, not labels.
