+## 2026-05-19 08:03 +03 - BE-0365
+- What was implemented
+  - Added `telemetry.JobQueueMetrics`, a concurrency-safe in-process durable-job queue metrics collector with low-cardinality dimensions (`event`, `job_type`, `status`, `status_class`) and latest-sample job/request/correlation/org/resource hints.
+  - Wired `worker.StoreClaimer` to emit claim and committed outcome metrics for success, retry, terminal failure, dead-letter, and shutdown release paths.
+  - Added operator documentation for job queue incident workflows and redaction boundaries.
